Description: guitar tablature and score viewer
 OxiGuitar opens Guitar Pro files (.gp, .gpx, .gp5, .gp4, .gp3) and
 shows them as standard notation and tablature in four layouts, with any
 set of tracks together. It edits and saves them, exports them to PDF,
 and plays them with the system's sound set or better ones the user adds
 (SoundFont and SFZ). No telemetry: it never uploads anything.
 .
 OxiGuitar opens and plays files only through plugins, which are packages
 of their own: oxiguitar-guitarpro (Guitar Pro files), oxiguitar-midi
 (sound) and oxiguitar-alsa and oxiguitar-pipewire (audio output), all
 recommended, and oxiguitar-nam (amplifier models), suggested.
